      "title": "Assistant or Associate Professor – Ph.D. Program in Anthropology",
      "url": "https://cuny.jobs/new-york-ny/assistant-or-associate-professor-phd-program-in-anthropology/6CB634BD5497413C806369D5D22A4F62/job/",
